{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"杰夫·贝佐斯·思想与方法","stage":"DONE","category":"jeff-bezos","categoryLabel":"杰夫·贝佐斯","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/09_jeff-bezos/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"思想与方法\">思想与方法</h1><p>本卷剖析杰夫·贝佐斯<strong>可迁移的思维工具与工作方法</strong>——那些不依赖亚马逊具体业务、其他组织也能学用的理念与流程。它们大多有确切出处：2016 年致股东信（Day 1 与高速度决策）、2015 年致股东信（单向门/双向门）、2004 年 6 月那封禁用 PowerPoint 的内部邮件（六页备忘录）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷的分工\">本卷 vs. 兄弟卷的分工</h2><p>贝佐斯人物 hub 共六卷，容易与本卷混淆的有两卷，请按下表各取所需：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>做成了什么</strong>（重塑零售、AWS、贝佐斯剧本）</td>\n<td>讲业务成果与战略；本卷讲成果背后的<strong>通用方法</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>思想与方法（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>他<strong>怎么想、怎么决策、怎么做产品</strong></td>\n<td>可迁移的思维工具，独立于具体业务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与事业</a></td>\n<td>他的<strong>人生轨迹</strong></td>\n<td>讲传记事件；本卷的方法在何时形成可在此找到背景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条经验法则：如果你想学&quot;如何决策/如何开会/如何立项&quot;，读本卷；如果你想知道&quot;亚马逊靠什么赢&quot;，读核心贡献卷。注意&quot;客户至上&quot;作为<strong>理念</strong>在 <a href=\"../core-contributions/the-bezos-playbook/customer-obsession\">贝佐斯剧本·客户至上</a>，而它作为<strong>可操作流程</strong>（逆向工作法）在本卷第三章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章地图\">三章地图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Day 1 理念&lt;br/&gt;心态与组织活力] --&gt; B[决策之道&lt;br/&gt;怎么拍板]&#10;    B --&gt; C[逆向工作法&lt;br/&gt;怎么造产品/怎么沟通]&#10;    A -.高速度决策是 Day 1 四武器之一.-&gt; B&#10;    C -.写作即思考是逆向工作法的认识论.-&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[Day 1 理念&lt;br/&gt;心态与组织活力] --&gt; B[决策之道&lt;br/&gt;怎么拍板]\n    B --&gt; C[逆向工作法&lt;br/&gt;怎么造产品/怎么沟通]\n    A -.高速度决策是 Day 1 四武器之一.-&gt; B\n    C -.写作即思考是逆向工作法的认识论.-&gt; B</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 <a href=\"day-1-philosophy/\">Day 1 理念</a></strong>：<a href=\"day-1-philosophy/always-day-1\">永远的第一天</a> 给出四件防御武器的总框架；<a href=\"day-1-philosophy/avoiding-day-2\">避免 Day 2 的衰败</a> 诊断衰败机制（核心是&quot;代理指标&quot;陷阱）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 <a href=\"decision-making/\">决策之道</a></strong>：<a href=\"decision-making/high-velocity-decisions\">高质量快速决策</a> 讲&quot;速度&quot;维度（70% 法则、disagree and commit）；<a href=\"decision-making/two-way-doors\">单向门与双向门</a> 讲&quot;可逆性&quot;分类维度。两篇合成一套&quot;按可逆性给延迟定价&quot;的决策系统。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 <a href=\"working-backwards/\">逆向工作法</a></strong>：<a href=\"working-backwards/starting-from-the-customer\">从客户出发</a> 讲 PR/FAQ 这一&quot;自欺探测器&quot;；<a href=\"working-backwards/the-narrative-and-memo\">叙述与六页备忘录</a> 讲沉默自习课与&quot;写作即思考&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>无硬前置，但建议顺序阅读：第一章奠定<strong>为什么要快、要客户中心</strong>（心态层），第二章给出<strong>怎么快速决策</strong>（决策层），第三章给出<strong>怎么把客户中心落成流程</strong>（执行层）。三层环环相扣——高速度决策是 Day 1 的四件武器之一，写作即思考又是逆向工作法的认识论根基。</p>\n<p>读完本卷后，推荐延伸到 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/influence-on-business/\">影响与遗产·对商业的影响</a>，看这些方法如何被科技业广泛吸收；或到 <a href=\"../major-works/shareholder-letters/\">重大著作·致股东信</a>，读这些理念的第一手原始出处。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"day-1-philosophy","title":"Day 1理念","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods/day-1-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"always-day-1","title":"永远的第一天","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods/day-1-philosophy/always-day-1"},{"seq":2,"slug":"avoiding-day-2","title":"避免 Day 2 的衰败","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods/day-1-philosophy/avoiding-day-2"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"decision-making","title":"决策之道","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods/decision-making","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"high-velocity-decisions","title":"高质量快速决策","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods/decision-making/high-velocity-decisions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"two-way-doors","title":"单向门与双向门","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods/decision-making/two-way-doors"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"working-backwards","title":"逆向工作法","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods/working-backwards","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"starting-from-the-customer","title":"从客户出发","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods/working-backwards/starting-from-the-customer"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-narrative-and-memo","title":"叙述与六页备忘录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/ideas-and-methods/working-backwards/the-narrative-and-memo"}]}]}